('waec','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for electrical resistance?','[{"id":"A","text":"coulomb"},{"id":"B","text":"ohm"},{"id":"C","text":"ampere"},{"id":"D","text":"volt"}]'::jsonb,'B','Electrical resistance is measured in ohms (Ω).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for potential difference?','[{"id":"A","text":"volt"},{"id":"B","text":"ohm"},{"id":"C","text":"ampere"},{"id":"D","text":"watt"}]'::jsonb,'A','Potential difference is measured in volts (V).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','A key purpose of clean water in livestock management is to support:','[{"id":"A","text":"Health, growth and reproduction"},{"id":"B","text":"Rusting of equipment"},{"id":"C","text":"Soil erosion"},{"id":"D","text":"Seed dormancy"}]'::jsonb,'A','Good feed and clean water are essential for healthy livestock growth and reproduction.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Crop rotation can help plants explore different soil layers because different crops have:','[{"id":"A","text":"Only surface roots"},{"id":"B","text":"Different rooting depths"},{"id":"C","text":"Identical root systems"},{"id":"D","text":"No roots"}]'::jsonb,'B','FAO explains that different rooting depths allow crops to explore different soil layers.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Leguminous crops can contribute to soil fertility mainly through:','[{"id":"A","text":"Biological nitrogen fixation"},{"id":"B","text":"Removing all soil nitrogen"},{"id":"C","text":"Increasing soil salinity"},{"id":"D","text":"Stopping root growth"}]'::jsonb,'A','FAO notes that legumes in rotations can add nitrogen through biological fixation.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which animal is NOT a ruminant?','[{"id":"A","text":"Goat"},{"id":"B","text":"Sheep"},{"id":"C","text":"Cattle"},{"id":"D","text":"Chicken"}]'::jsonb,'D','Chickens are not ruminants; cattle, sheep and goats are.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which combination lists nutrients animals require in their feed?','[{"id":"A","text":"Only protein"},{"id":"B","text":"Only carbohydrates"},{"id":"C","text":"Carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins and minerals"},{"id":"D","text":"Only water and salt"}]'::jsonb,'C','FAO lists carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins and minerals among required feed nutrients.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which group contains only common ruminant livestock?','[{"id":"A","text":"Cattle, sheep and goats"},{"id":"B","text":"Pigs, chickens and rabbits"},{"id":"C","text":"Chickens, ducks and turkeys"},{"id":"D","text":"Pigs, rabbits and poultry"}]'::jsonb,'A','FAO identifies cattle, sheep and goats as ruminant livestock.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which nutrient group is a major source of energy in animal feed?','[{"id":"A","text":"Water only"},{"id":"B","text":"Vitamins only"},{"id":"C","text":"Carbohydrates"},{"id":"D","text":"Minerals only"}]'::jsonb,'C','Carbohydrates are an important energy source in feed.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which nutrient is especially important as a building material for muscles in animals?','[{"id":"A","text":"Ash"},{"id":"B","text":"Carbon dioxide"},{"id":"C","text":"Protein"},{"id":"D","text":"Water only"}]'::jsonb,'C','FAO animal-health guidance describes protein as a building block needed for muscles.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which of the following is a major benefit of crop rotation?','[{"id":"A","text":"Prevention of every plant disease"},{"id":"B","text":"Improved nutrient use and reduced pest risk"},{"id":"C","text":"Permanent removal of all soil organisms"},{"id":"D","text":"Elimination of water needs"}]'::jsonb,'B','Crop rotation can improve nutrient use and reduce pest and weed risks.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which practice can improve the diversity of soil flora and fauna?','[{"id":"A","text":"Growing only one crop continuously"},{"id":"B","text":"Removing all crop residues"},{"id":"C","text":"Eliminating all roots"},{"id":"D","text":"Rotating different crop species"}]'::jsonb,'D','FAO notes that crop diversity in rotation supports diverse soil flora and fauna.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which practice helps reduce the carry-over of crop-specific pests and diseases?','[{"id":"A","text":"Bush burning"},{"id":"B","text":"Crop rotation"},{"id":"C","text":"Continuous monocropping"},{"id":"D","text":"Overgrazing"}]'::jsonb,'B','FAO notes that crop rotation helps prevent carry-over of crop-specific pests and diseases.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which three nutrients are commonly referred to as NPK fertilizer nutrients?','[{"id":"A","text":"Nitrogen, protein and potassium"},{"id":"B","text":"Nitrate, phosphate and kerosene"},{"id":"C","text":"Nickel, phosphorus and krypton"},{"id":"D","text":"Nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium"}]'::jsonb,'D','NPK refers to nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','A current asset is generally expected to be converted to cash within:','[{"id":"A","text":"Fifty years"},{"id":"B","text":"No defined period"},{"id":"C","text":"One year"},{"id":"D","text":"Ten years"}]'::jsonb,'C','Current assets are generally expected to convert to cash within one year.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','A truck used in business operations and not held for resale is usually a:','[{"id":"A","text":"Noncurrent/fixed asset"},{"id":"B","text":"Current liability"},{"id":"C","text":"Revenue account"},{"id":"D","text":"Dividend"}]'::jsonb,'A','Operational property such as trucks is generally a fixed/noncurrent asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Inventory is generally classified as:','[{"id":"A","text":"A dividend"},{"id":"B","text":"An asset"},{"id":"C","text":"A liability"},{"id":"D","text":"An expense only"}]'::jsonb,'B','Inventory is an asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Shareholders'' equity is best described as:','[{"id":"A","text":"All cash sales"},{"id":"B","text":"Only bank loans"},{"id":"C","text":"The company''s tax bill"},{"id":"D","text":"The residual interest after liabilities are deducted from assets"}]'::jsonb,'D','Equity is the residual interest after liabilities are deducted from assets.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which equation summarises a balance sheet?','[{"id":"A","text":"Liabilities = Cash + Sales"},{"id":"B","text":"Assets = Liabilities + Shareholders'' Equity"},{"id":"C","text":"Revenue = Assets + Cash"},{"id":"D","text":"Assets = Revenue - Expenses"}]'::jsonb,'B','A balance sheet follows Assets = Liabilities + Shareholders'' Equity.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement reports cash exchanges with the outside world over a period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Inventory card"},{"id":"B","text":"Purchase order"},{"id":"C","text":"Cash flow statement"},{"id":"D","text":"Balance sheet only"}]'::jsonb,'C','The cash flow statement reports cash inflows and outflows over a period.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement shows revenues and expenses over a period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"B","text":"Share certificate"},{"id":"C","text":"Bank mandate"},{"id":"D","text":"Income statement"}]'::jsonb,'D','An income statement reports what a company made and spent over a period.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement shows what a company owns and owes at a specific point in time?','[{"id":"A","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"B","text":"Income statement"},{"id":"C","text":"Cash flow statement"},{"id":"D","text":"Sales invoice"}]'::jsonb,'A','A balance sheet is a point-in-time statement of assets, liabilities and equity.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which item is normally a liability?','[{"id":"A","text":"Amount owed to a supplier"},{"id":"B","text":"Cash in hand"},{"id":"C","text":"Inventory held for sale"},{"id":"D","text":"Equipment owned"}]'::jsonb,'A','Amounts owed to suppliers are liabilities.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which item is normally an asset?','[{"id":"A","text":"Trade payable"},{"id":"B","text":"Cash"},{"id":"C","text":"Bank loan payable"},{"id":"D","text":"Tax payable"}]'::jsonb,'B','Cash is an asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which statement is a snapshot at the end of a reporting period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Cash flow statement only"},{"id":"B","text":"Sales journal"},{"id":"C","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"D","text":"Income statement only"}]'::jsonb,'C','A balance sheet reports financial position at a point in time.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which statement shows changes in shareholders'' interests over time?','[{"id":"A","text":"Purchase order"},{"id":"B","text":"Bank teller slip"},{"id":"C","text":"Inventory requisition"},{"id":"D","text":"Statement of shareholders'' equity"}]'::jsonb,'D','The statement of shareholders'' equity shows changes in owners'' interests over time.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Each Nigerian state is represented in the Senate by how many senatorial districts?','[{"id":"A","text":"One"},{"id":"B","text":"Two"},{"id":"C","text":"Five"},{"id":"D","text":"Three"}]'::jsonb,'D','Each of the 36 states has three senatorial districts.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','How many members make up Nigeria''s House of Representatives?','[{"id":"A","text":"360"},{"id":"B","text":"109"},{"id":"C","text":"72"},{"id":"D","text":"774"}]'::jsonb,'A','The House of Representatives has 360 members.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','How many senators make up Nigeria''s Senate?','[{"id":"A","text":"74"},{"id":"B","text":"109"},{"id":"C","text":"360"},{"id":"D","text":"36"}]'::jsonb,'B','The Senate has 109 senators.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Nigeria''s National Assembly is:','[{"id":"A","text":"Tricameral"},{"id":"B","text":"Non-legislative"},{"id":"C","text":"Bicameral"},{"id":"D","text":"Unicameral"}]'::jsonb,'C','The National Assembly has two chambers: the Senate and the House of Representatives.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','The Federal Capital Territory contributes how many senatorial district to the Senate?','[{"id":"A","text":"Three"},{"id":"B","text":"None"},{"id":"C","text":"One"},{"id":"D","text":"Two"}]'::jsonb,'C','The FCT is represented by one senatorial district.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Under Nigeria''s 1999 Constitution, executive powers are primarily addressed in which section?','[{"id":"A","text":"Section 5"},{"id":"B","text":"Section 4"},{"id":"C","text":"Section 6"},{"id":"D","text":"Section 9"}]'::jsonb,'A','Section 5 concerns executive powers.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Under Nigeria''s 1999 Constitution, judicial powers are primarily addressed in which section?','[{"id":"A","text":"Section 4"},{"id":"B","text":"Section 5"},{"id":"C","text":"Section 8"},{"id":"D","text":"Section 6"}]'::jsonb,'D','Section 6 concerns judicial powers.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Under Nigeria''s 1999 Constitution, legislative powers are primarily addressed in which section?','[{"id":"A","text":"Section 7"},{"id":"B","text":"Section 4"},{"id":"C","text":"Section 5"},{"id":"D","text":"Section 6"}]'::jsonb,'B','Section 4 concerns legislative powers.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
