('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Which chamber is commonly called Nigeria''s Red Chamber?','[{"id":"A","text":"Senate"},{"id":"B","text":"House of Representatives"},{"id":"C","text":"Supreme Court"},{"id":"D","text":"Federal Executive Council"}]'::jsonb,'A','The Senate is commonly referred to as the Red Chamber.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Which is a core function of the National Assembly?','[{"id":"A","text":"Registering vehicles"},{"id":"B","text":"Lawmaking"},{"id":"C","text":"Issuing passports"},{"id":"D","text":"Printing currency"}]'::jsonb,'B','Core National Assembly functions include lawmaking, representation and oversight.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('waec','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Which National Assembly function involves scrutinising public institutions and officials?','[{"id":"A","text":"Passport printing"},{"id":"B","text":"Judicial sentencing"},{"id":"C","text":"Oversight"},{"id":"D","text":"Currency issuance"}]'::jsonb,'C','Oversight is a core parliamentary function.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
